<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 5564 0 R/Alt(State diagram with three states. StIdle with busy_o 0 and done_o 0 is entered at reset and stays there while start_i is low. With start_i high it goes to StRun, where busy_o is 1. StRun stays while last_i is low and goes to StDone when last_i is high. StDone, where done_o is 1, always returns to StIdle.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[44]/Pg 31553 0 R>>
