12340 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 12341 0 R/Alt(Timing diagram over eight clock cycles. start_i is high in cycle 2, last_i in cycle 4. The RTL state is unknown in cycle 0, then StIdle, StRun in cycles 3 and 4, StDone in cycle 5, and StIdle again. In the RTL, busy_o is high in cycles 3 and 4 and done_o in cycle 5, and both are low in cycle 0. In the gate-level simulation, busy_o is unknown in cycles 0 to 2 and high in cycles 3 and 4, and done_o is unknown in cycle 0 and high in cycle 5. With random start values, busy_o is high from cycle 0 to 4 for seed 3, and done_o is high in cycles 0 and 5 for seed 9.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31604 0 R>>
