19338 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 19339 0 R/Alt(Line chart. The horizontal axis is the output load from 0 to 0.3 pF, the vertical axis the delay from 0 to about 1.6 ns. Four lines in blue shades of increasing darkness are the input slews 0.0186, 0.174, 0.3294, and 1.263 ns. Each rises with the load. The line for 0.0186 ns is almost straight, the lines for slower slews are steeper at small loads and bend, and a larger slew shifts the line up. A black point at 0.05 pF and 0.2775 ns lies between the lines for 0.174 and 0.3294 ns.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31674 0 R>>
endobj
