22251 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 22252 0 R/Alt(Two circuit diagrams. (a) The input d enters the 1-input of a multiplexer, whose output drives D of a flip-flop. The output Q of the flip-flop is the output q and also feeds back into the 0-input of the multiplexer. The signal en drives the select input of the multiplexer, and clk drives the clock input of the flip-flop. (b) A dashed box labeled lgcp_1 contains a latch and an AND gate. en drives D of the latch, whose gate input with an inversion bubble is driven by clk. The latch output and clk drive the AND gate, whose output gclk drives the clock input of the flip-flop. d drives D of the flip-flop directly.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[17]/Pg 31715 0 R>>
endobj
