<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 22643 0 R/Alt(Block diagram split by a vertical dashed line into domain A on the left and domain B on the right. In domain A, a register clocked by clk_a drives a wire across the line to flip-flop FF1, clocked by clk_b, whose output is labeled may be metastable. FF1 drives flip-flop FF2, also clocked by clk_b, and FF2 drives a logic block of domain B. A bracket between FF1 and FF2 says one period to resolve.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31723 0 R>>
