25364 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 25365 0 R/Alt(Two diagrams. (a) A multiplexer with inputs D at 0 and SCD at 1 and select input SCE drives the D input of a flip-flop clocked by CLK, whose output is Q. A dashed box around both is labeled sdfrbpq_1. (b) A wide green box labeled combinational logic sits above three scan flip-flops FF1, FF2 and FF3. Each flip-flop gets its D input from the logic and returns its output Q to the logic. An orange path runs from the input scan_in into the SCD input of FF1, from the output of FF1 into SCD of FF2, from FF2 into SCD of FF3, and from FF3 to the output scan_out. An orange line scan_enable reaches the SCE inputs of all three, and a red line clk their clock inputs.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[25]/Pg 31753 0 R>>
endobj
