<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 25704 0 R/Alt(Flow diagram in three rows. Middle row from left to right: netlist from Yosys, scan_replace in OpenROAD, placement in OpenROAD, execute_dft_plan in OpenROAD, and the netlist with scan chains. Top row: the equivalence check scan_eq.tcl, fed by arrows from the netlist and from the netlist with scan chains. Bottom row from left to right: fault cut and fault atpg, fed by the netlist, then test vectors, scan_patterns.py, scan patterns, and the simulation tb_scan.sv. An arrow labeled chain order leads from the netlist with scan chains to scan_patterns.py, and another arrow from the netlist with scan chains to the simulation. Tools are green boxes, design data blue boxes.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31757 0 R>>
