26488 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 26489 0 R/Alt(Six boxes in a row, connected by arrows: synthesis with Yosys, floorplan with OpenROAD, placement with OpenROAD, clock tree synthesis with OpenROAD, routing with OpenROAD, and signoff with OpenRCX, OpenSTA, Magic, KLayout and Netgen. Below each box, a list of its steps. Synthesis: lint, synthesis, mapping. Floorplan: die and core, rows, IO pins, power grid. Placement: global placement, buffering, detailed placement. Clock tree: clock tree, setup repair, hold repair. Routing: global routing, antenna repair, detailed routing, fill and decap. Signoff: extraction, timing in all corners, IR drop, GDS, DRC and LVS.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31768 0 R>>
endobj
